{"id":"wb-6-608","name":"婺源宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"婺源宗祠","text":"婺源宗祠位于中国江西省婺源县，是徽州建筑的典型代表。\n2006年，包括篁村余氏宗祠、阳春方氏宗祠、汪口俞氏宗祠、黄村经义堂、洪村光裕堂、西冲敦伦堂、豸峰成义堂七处，被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n2018年，包括岭下村大经堂、水岚村詹氏宗祠、豸峰村资深堂、旃坑村萧江宗祠、洪村霭庭公祠五处，被列为第六批江西省文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A9%BA%E6%BA%90%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":90816020,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90816020","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8345bb682cd08cd0a5030d20.jpg","title":"Wuyuan_Tuochuan_Huangcun_20120402-12.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wuyuan_Tuochuan_Huangcun_20120402-12.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/Wuyuan_Tuochuan_Huangcun_20120402-12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​篁村余氏宗祠，位于中国江西省婺源县沱川乡。","width":320,"height":213}}